---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions — Free LinkedIn Text Formatter"
  description="Read our Terms and Conditions. Free for personal and commercial use. Independent utility not affiliated with or endorsed by LinkedIn Corporation."
>
  <section class="py-12 md:py-16 bg-canvas">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      {/* Header */}
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline px-3 py-1 rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider">
          Legal & Usage Terms
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mt-3">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono mt-2">
          Effective Date: August 18, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Terms Content */}
      <div class="space-y-8 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans">
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using <strong>Free LinkedIn Text Formatter</strong> (`freelinkedintextformatter.com`), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should not use this web application.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">2. Permitted Use</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Our text formatting utility is provided free of charge for both <strong>personal and commercial content creation</strong>. You are permitted to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-body pl-2">
            <li>Format text for social media posts, headlines, bios, and marketing messages.</li>
            <li>Copy and publish formatted Unicode text to any platform of your choice.</li>
            <li>Use the tool without creating an account or paying subscription fees.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">3. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
          <p>
            You agree not to use this service to generate, format, or transmit content that is illegal, defamatory, abusive, or intended to bypass platform security filters or engage in malicious spam activities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">4. Trademark Disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed">
            "LinkedIn" is a registered trademark of <strong>LinkedIn Corporation</strong>. <strong>Free LinkedIn Text Formatter</strong> is an independent third-party tool and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or associated with LinkedIn Corporation or Microsoft Corporation. All other trademarks belong to their respective owners.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>
            This service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access or that third-party platforms will always render specific Unicode character ranges identically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            In no event shall the creators or operators of this tool be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from your use or inability to use the service.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">7. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For questions or inquiries regarding these Terms & Conditions, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 p-4 bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink">
            Email: <a href="mailto:support@freelinkedintextformatter.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">support@freelinkedintextformatter.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
